#tr.en: May Enki and Ninmaḫ not change it, may An not change it. 
>>Q000380 511 
512. iri du3-du3-a ug3 szar2-szar2-ra 
#tr.en: That cities should be rebuilt, that people should be numerous, 
>>Q000380 512 
